cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas, please cite it as below."
title: "diskatlas: all-sky interactive atlas for resolved circumstellar disks and imaged companions"
abstract: >-
  An offline, interactive all-sky atlas of every system with a resolved
  circumstellar disk (mm/submm interferometry, high-contrast scattered light and
  thermal IR, resolved far-IR imaging), a directly imaged companion, or a
  coronagraphically imaged quasar host. Each image is a cropped panel from the
  discovery or characterization paper with per-image arXiv/SciX citations.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The diskatlas authors"
url: "https://seawander.github.io/diskatlas/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/seawander/diskatlas"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - protoplanetary disks
  - debris disks
  - directly imaged exoplanets
  - high-contrast imaging
  - circumstellar disks
  - data visualization
